# Implement Google Authentication

Add "Sign in with Google" to the application to allow doctors and hospital admins to authenticate seamlessly.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> To fully test and use Google Authentication, you will need a **Google Client ID**.
> You can obtain this from the [Google Cloud Console](https://console.cloud.google.com/) by creating an OAuth 2.0 Client ID for a Web Application.
> 
> You will need to add this Client ID to your `.env` file once we implement the feature.

